bronchodilator (useful in asthma/bronchospasm);
IM route if no IV access;
avoid in hypertensive crisis,
elevated ICP (controversial)</td></tr><tr><td><b>Propofol</b></td><td>2–3 mg/kg IV (&lt; 3 yrs: up to 4 mg/kg)</td><td>Excellent conditions for elective intubation;
