000 or coagulopathy;

if urgent GA required with coagulopathy — accept higher airway trauma risk but proceed</li><li>Ensure foetal heart rate monitoring is maintained throughout induction and laryngoscopy where possible</li></ul></div></div><!-- /tab-obs --><!-- FOOTER --><div class="footer"><p><b>Airway Management Algorithm</b>— Adult · Pediatric · Obstetric</p><p>Evidence Base: ASA 2022 · DAS 2015 · OAA/DAS 2015 · DAS Paediatric 2015 · PALS 2020 · NAP4 2011 · MBRRACE-UK 2022</p><p>For educational and reference use only. Not a substitute for clinical judgment or institutional protocols.</p><p>Generated May 2026 · Compiled by Claude (Anthropic) for <b>Abdelwahab</b></p></div></div><!-- /container --><script>function tog(id) {
